## Decorator Flow

```text
Function Call
      ↓
Wrapper Starts
      ↓
Get Function Name
      ↓
Record Start Time
      ↓
Run Original Function
      ↓
Store Return Value
      ↓
Record End Time
      ↓
Calculate Execution Time
      ↓
Function Completed Message
      ↓
Return Original Result
```

